Pornography the Samurai had a slow start.  However, he quickly
accelerated into my most promising candidate for ascension yet.  He
got a bag of holding from Sokoban and quickly blessed it.  He later
found another bag of holding, which he also blessed and used for
wands.  He picked up lots of scrolls and potions along his journey,
but thanks to an abundance of magic markers, fountains and altars, he
was able to produce enough blessed scrolls of identify to get all of
his things... identified.  Furthermore, there were plenty of altars,
allowing Pornography to make holy water at his leisure.  Sacrificing
yielded Frost Brand, Sunsword and Demonbane, and dipping yielded
Excalibur.  However, no scrolls of enchant weapon were found until
after the Quest.

A wand of polymorph was found, and used to polypile and transform
Hachi the large dog at the same time.  Hachi the dog ended up as Queen
Gainer the wood nymph, who sadly died in Sokoban (they just have the
worst luck there, don't they?) and the polypile yielded a Hawaiian
shirt (which was quickly fireproofed and enchanted to +4) and a
two-handed sword, with which Pornography advanced to Expert in
preparation for the Tsurugi of Muramasa.

Pornography was having an easy enough time.  Between levels 10 and 20,
though, he saw a cyan D.  Semicolon, move over to the D... silver
dragon.  Eep.  Wait, its name is Yo-Yo?  What the hell kind of name is
that?

...a bonesfile!  Free loot!  And the bag of holding contained 2
blessed scrolls of remove curse...

Anyway, Pornography stupidly zapped his wand of lightning at the
dragon; fortunately, though, the rebound missed.  Soon, the dragon was
dead anyway, and Pornography had a shiny new suit of silver dragon
scale mail, quickly enchanted to +4.  He got teleportitis, but
fortunately had a ring of teleport control handy.  Nice.  Then some
joker with a wand of lightning turned that =oTC to dust.  No more were
found during the course of the game.  Then our samurai friend stepped
on a polymorph trap and turned into a silver dragon.  Ooops, no more
fireproof +4 Hawaiian shirt.  Uttering various dragon obscenities,
Pornography continued bravely on even after he reverted to human form.

The Quest was fairly anticlimactic.  Ashikaga Takauji teleported next
to Pornography, raising his Tsurugi of Muramasa... only to catch a
death ray in the face.  A cloak of displacement was found nearby, and
fun was had.

Later on, an Aleax and a troll were tamed, and many shopkeepers were
killed.  Much protection was bought, decreasing Pornography's naked AC
to -1.

Flash forward to Pornography around level 20.  Two good pets, a
blessed rustproof +5 Tsurugi of Muramasa, rustproof +4 Frost Brand, +4
SDSM, fireproof +5 [oDisplacement, and lots of goodies in two bags of
holding.  No way to go but down, right?

...Wait, no magic resistance.  That's the oversight that would prove
fatal.

Medusa was easy.  Opened the door, stepped in with the SDSM shining,
Medusa turned to stone.  The statue of Perseus had a scimitar, which
Pornography wasn't interested in.  Down to the mazes.

On the second level of the mazes, a purple L showed up.  A master
lich.  No problem, he's no match for this +5 Tsurugi of Muramasa. 
Maybe I'll even bisect him.

No such luck.  He teleported away with every hit of the Tsurugi, and
was never bisected.  Pornography's stuff was cursed several times;
once both bags of holding became uncursed.  Of course, the master lich
didn't bother teleporting away when Pornography pulled his 20 potions
of holy water out of his bag of holding.  20 potions of holy water
soon became 2, due to some frost.  Then the lich started destroying
armor.

Of course, the first things to go were the fireproof +5 cloak of
displacement and the +4 SDSM.  Eeep.  Death followed soon after.

Lesson learned?  Get magic resistance at any cost.  That or a scroll
of genocide.  I think I found an instance of every type of scroll
EXCEPT genocide.  Arr.

547,939 points in 61,022 moves.  That's five times my second highest
score.

